  <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">Keys from Vertex AI, Workspace Gemini, or Gemini Enterprise will not work with the Agent API.
&lt;/Info&gt;</data>
</edge>
